/* Diff palettes are audited against the uniform added/removed line fills at
   3.5:1. Keep these opaque: every diff block for a theme must present syntax
   colors against the same two known backgrounds. They own every --bg-diff-*
   token and stay grouped here rather than in the theme blocks above. */
